<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:48:03 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Phi-e-rơ thưq vaarq</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Phi-e-rơ</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pe</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Phi-e-rơ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Si-môn Phi-e-rơ, xapok ji adro jah rơơlh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, atăq khơl adro heq nhonq xok kung muuyq xuum tuôq quiq bauq đaji 'wot đom varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk ji Wơơt Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu: <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Apôôy vôôch vanong kaxay ji varơuq hrok hrol 'ngưng athêêp iaq đnoyq ka oh ay đom varơuq nhonq xet Kơy Plêêk ji Lôôk Jê-xu, Lôôk haay. <verse eid="2PE 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Vii heq kahniq ka haay tôôy varơuq wih truh varơuq riirh ji varơuq kuh kul tyauq yaak qwuyen ku Kadraq, gamưh varơuq nhonq xet Kơy heq tawooyh taayh haay xing tađnah tađnaak ji varơuq xuum kaxay ku Kadraq, <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />đơu gamưh tađnah tađnaak xuum kaxay nưq, Kadraq heq kahniq ka haay kaluh apok tavek quiq jaq ji kôt galơh, xôq gamưh đnư oh ay jah jêêk vlôh khơl adro e phon xuum katik kơy plêêk, xaloot klơlh đơơy riirh hư hlơơp đom dêh araak bơyh xuum hmưch trôôch, <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />đơu bơyh kakơq nưq, atêq tuôôy dơơp tyauq dêq hloay varơuq garơng talăng jăk, oh ay dayh athêêp ka xuum tuôq haay xuum kaxay; athêêp ka xuum kaxay hlolh xet; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />athêêp ka hlolh xet katik jư xăk; athêêp ka katik jư xăk paraat chiuq uunq; athêêp ka paraat chiuq uunq varơuq kuh kul; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />athêêp ka varơuq kuh kul xuum xiaq trôôch oh ay; athêêp ka xuum xiaq trôôch oh ay xuum xung xiaq. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Vii tuôôy kaluh varơuq nưq kahnoq ji e raah jôôh đom oh ay, yôôych varơuq xalih truh tol oh ay leh hnoq laa varơuq văch xiap long be vlôh play đom varơuq nhonq xet Lôôk haay laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Bơyh kaluh varơuq nưq leh kahnoq đom adro leq, yôôych adro nưq kadih laa biq apul vơơl, pa hno, pang waq muut varơuq tawol varơuq pa xarêh kaluh kadrôôp ku ni adroyq neq. <verse eid="2PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Anưq yôôych, wơơy oh ay, dayh talăng jăk iaq đnoyq xôq dơơp kajưk apok taayh ji varơuq jah rơơlh ku oh ay, vii tuôôy dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq nưq, oh ay kajưk dik hnoq leh dong leq xatôôlh gưlh. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Gamưh anưq, varơuq tawaak muut đom daak plêêk đơơy đơơy ku Lôôk ji Wơơt Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, hnoq jah ăm kach raah jôh ka oh ay.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Vii anưq, gô hnoq hloay talăng jăk hmưk nhăk oh ay truh kaluh varơuq nưq ju oh ay heq xet ji jah dơơp kajưk đom varơuq dik đong kahnoq aduq oh ay. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Bơh long dong leq gô hloay e măn đom raap đơ neq, gô biit varơuq troq nhưk duh dơơp laa ahluk anhơơu oh ay xing varơuq hmưk nhăk, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />vii xet đaneq varơuq tơq pơ raap ku gô laa varơuq jeq xalih vlôh, dang đaji Lôôk haay, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu kung heq kahnoq vlôh ka gô. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Ju anưq, gô kung hnoq raanq paraat đom tôôy kawah, xôq dơơp ka oh ay hloay văch kaluh varơuq neq atêq varơuq vlôh hooy ku gô. <verse eid="2PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Vii 'wot heq be kahnoq ka oh ay bơyh xatyauq kaluh varơuq biit ravơq kheoq đnooy pahnhiq truh taay yaak ji varơuq rama truh ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, bơh vii heq jêêk vlôh khơl adro ka kangưưr dưk xanok varơuq ra uk ku kadih Kadraq. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Vii Kadraq heq nhonq xok varơuq vado ji tađnah tađnaak xing Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq, tuôôy apok xanoh đaneq heq jah đnooy vlôh truh Kadraq bơyh Kơy Taay Yaak Tađnah Tađnaak: “Neq laa Koot Gô, Koot xung xiaq ku Gô, Gô thier hlah xuum truh Koot nưq.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Kadih 'wot kung heq tameng apok đnooy nưq jah đnooy vlôh xing plêêk, đong tuôôy măn dii Kadraq tol đoot vah. <verse eid="2PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Lunưq, 'wot e apok hlit thier kajưk, laa varơuq đơu oh ay đong dơơp troq tuôôy văch 'yo truh, đaji laa văch 'yo gooy đeen ahnhe đom aduq kamơng jaluk, dong truh tuôôy ka hngơy hrưng tađnah ji xalok maai vlok tok đom xuum oh ay, <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />bơyh xet varơuq neq adroyq nhưk, đaneq tôôy apok hlit đom Rahlăp Vah leh truh xing varơuq padoh hlolh đêh ku kơyq nưq. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Vii leh dong leq e apok hlit leq jah đnooy vlôh bơyh iq trôôch ku koot manih, bơh tuôôy jah jarooy trôôk bơyh Kơy Phool Hiel, oot heq đnooy vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Long anưq, đaji khơl hlit pa ôôh heq măn katul manih karôp, yôôych khơl thơy pato pa ôôh kung hnoq măn katul oh ay, 'ngưq laa khơl adro hnoq leenq xagook muut kaluh apok tagêh phaq phek ji vii chôôyq ka'lăk Manih Kôôch heq wơơt root oh ay, lunưq varoh xok kadih varơuq kaxêêt hlơp thier talăng. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />'Ngưng adro hnoq dơơp atôôlh tyauq kaluh varơuq dơơp va ih va oop ku oot, đơu vii khơl adro nưq đơu đaauq ku varơuq dik hnoq biq đnooy ra ơơh. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Bơyh xuum hmưch, bơơn kaluh apok pa ôôh lar, oot hnoq parayh xok lơyq oh ay, đơu varơuq hmơt dook deng ka oot adroyq neq koq hmưq hlơơp, ji varơuq kaxêêt hlơơp ku oot be hmưq vik. <verse eid="2PE 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Vii atoh Kơy Plêêk heq leh tha ka'lăk khơl yaak plêêk lôp kadrôôp, bơh taweek pôôt raluk jaruq đom talơy looy tooy ku aduq kamơng jaluk, Kadraq pahnăp khơl adro biq jư 'yo nưq ka varơuq xưh xadrah; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp kadrơy đok: </char><char style="fqa">xôq biq rôp karuk đom kaluh raluk kamơng jaluk pi 'laarq dong truh tuôôy xưh xadrah</char>.</note> <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Kadraq kung heq leh tha ka'lăk dêh araak tuôôy hnu, bơh 'yo jư thơơm adro, e Nô-ê, laa manih pato dayq hyioh jăk, tuôôy Kadraq apôôt daak ngôp dêh pôôt dêh araak ku khơl adro xơk tauq; <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />ji tuôôy vuh kaluh theng Sô-đôm ji Gô-mô-rơ vlôh vlo thul, Kadraq heq ăm vlôh varơuq xadrah kaxêêt hlơp, dơơp atoh truh kaluh kajoq hnoq xalih truh ka khơl adro xơk tauq; <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />đơu Kadraq heq wơơt xok Lot hyioh jăk, đong tuôôy chiuq pơl dal vii katik xa măn đom varơuq apuq atrăp ku bing xơk tauq, <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />(bơyh manih hyioh jăk neq tuôôy riirh hngơy hlê hngơy katul bing oot heq biq jiq areh đom phool hiel hyioh jăk ku kơy vii hloq ji tameng kaluh varơuq xơk tauq); <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />yôôych Lôôk xet dơơp đaleq wơơt xok manih tuôq kul klơlh thưh thek ji rôp jư adro leh hyioh jăk xôq biq hmơt dook đom hngơy xưh xadrah, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />đơu nhưk laa đôôyq dii khơl adro ratuut đom kaluh hmưch trôôch hư hlơơp tyauq xăk xamơk ji 'yo be ra kajoq qwuyen da uh. Bing adro lar tauq găk akoq găk ranong, oot be yôq đnooy ra ơơh khơl kơy tađnah tađnaak; <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />đom tuôôy khơl yaak plêêk e paraat kalh ji taay yaak kôt iaq leh hmưq đnooy vlôh apok xưh xadrah ra ơơh, tachơơl hlê khơl kơy nưq kangưưr Lôôk. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Măn bing neq, đaji kaluh koot ôô leh xet biit, tyauq paraat jah pa iir vlôh xôq biq rôp ji păk kaxêêt dêq, đnooy ra ơơh truh kaluh varơuq đơu oot be hlolh xet, bing nưq kung hnoq biq păk kaxêêt dêq đaji varơuq kaxêêt hlơơp ku kaluh koot ôô hơq, <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />tuôôy biq bla hlê tyauq varơuq dơơp ku varơuq leh hyioh jăk, vii 'yo hmưch trôôch đaji varơuq xa agưt katul ka hngơy; bing oot laa kaluh hlêêl a'moh 'mơy ji klơl 'yêq, hlah trôôch đom varơuq pa ôôh lar ku oot tuôôy xa kawaal dii oh ay; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaluh rahlăp kadrơy đok: </char><char style="fqa">Oot hlah trôôch truh varơuq dơơp ku oot đong tuôôy xa hôôch dii oh ay đom kaluh waal xa xung xiaq</char>.</note> <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />e kaluh kalong mot viik varơuq apuq atrăp ji be padơy tabông 'yo muut kadrôôp maroh, adô aluut kaluh danưng kooy leh kajưk dơơp bơyq, ji e xuum klaak jah varơuq atuq katik hmưch tagoa, laa koot xau ku varơuq karoay axaap. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Vii ka'lăk ka trôôk hooy hyioh jăk, bing oot biq hyaak hyul tuôôy hooy tyauq ka trôôk ku Ba-la-am, koot kanau Bê-ô, adro hmưch trôôch jêêt kông ku varơuq be hyioh jăk. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq xôq rahlăp kadrơy đok: </char><char style="fqa">Ba-la-am, koot kanau Bô-xô</char>.</note> <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Bơh ni heq nhonq varơuq toah vii kadrôôp maroh ku ni — muuyq koot lưưa hôp heq klơl hlê varơuq adruôy khưrq ku hnhư hlit tuôôy đnooy bơơn apok manih. <verse eid="2PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Bing neq laa alook leh e daak ji laa xangoom kahliik biq đơơt khiel puh akhua hooy, laa khơl adro đơu aduq kamơng jaluk apul phil heq jah xôq 'miêh. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Vii, tuôôy đnooy kaluh apok pa ưưt akhwoak lưp e kajoq, bơyh hmưch trôôch a'moh 'mơy ku xăk xamơk, bing oot adô aluut khơl adro vơơ đơơu xaloot klơlh bing manih đong riirh đom bơyq ba, <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />tavek rayơh rayơơy ka khơl adro nưq, đom tuôôy kadih xăk bing oot laa xapok ku varơuq hư hlơơp. (Vii adro leq biq varơuq kajoq jay iaq, yôôych adro nưq biq dơơp xapok ka varơuq nưq.) <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Vii atoh heq xaloot klơlh đơơy riirh hư hlơơp ku dêh araak gamưh nhonq xet Lôôk ji Wơơt Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, bơh biq pang waq măk muut đnư wiit hlê, yôôych khơl adro nưq heq biq be jay, đơu varơuq atêq neq đôôyq dii oot jêêk vlôh ra ơơh iaq adroyq đnoyq. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Dik laa varơuq tolh iaq ka oot tuôôy leh xet trôôk hooy hyioh jăk iaq laa heq xet yôôch đơu wih katoor dii ganeen vah heq jah pato ka oot. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Apok dong dik ku apok đnooy hnu neq heq xalih vlôh ka oot: “Xo xa hlê tuôông heq hăk” ji “xuur heq hôôp xarêh valien amuaq đom wưk.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Oh ay xung xiaq, atêq ka muuyq kawah kawat, neq laa hla thư thưq vaarq gô valơk ka oh ay; đơu đom dêq vaarq hla thư, gô ahluk ahlul xuum biit dong dik ku oh ay bơơn varơuq ahmưk nhăk, <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />xôq văch hlê kaluh apok heq jah padoh đnooy adroyq neq bơyh khơl hlit vah kung dii apok patăk ku Lôôk ji Wơơt Lôôk gamưh khơl jah rơơlh ku oh ay, <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />vii xet adroyq varơuq neq, nưq laa khơl adro đnooy ra ơơh hnoq truh muut katuôôy lôôch dik dii varơuq xagiel ra ơơh, raxôôt tyauq hmưch trôôch ku kadih oot, <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />đơu đnooy: “Apok tavek truh varơuq wiit truh hlê ku Kadraq măn ka'leq? Vii xing tuôôy khơl mo kơy kaxêêt, tôôy thưq kưq măn ja xing hngơy panưk jêêk kapa tep.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Vii tuôôy tangưưr đanưq, varơuq neq jêêk vlôh đơ mot oot, nưq laa bơyh apok ku Kơy Plêêk, plêêk heq e xing hnu hmeq, ji vari jah dơơp vlôh xing daak ji gamưh daak, <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />kung bơyh kaluh varơuq nưq đơu dêh araak tuôôy nưq heq biq kaxêêt hlơơp, vii biq daak ngôp dêq. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Bơh juneq, bơyh kung apok nưq, plêêk ji vari jah deng ka ôôlh, jah jư ka hngơy xưh xadrah ji varơuq kaxêêt hlơơp khơl koot manih leh tuôq kul.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ju anưq, wơơy oh ay xung xiaq, te xôq muuyq varơuq neq jêêk vlôh đơ mot oh ay, đaneq muuyq hngơy đôôyq dii Lôôk dang đaji muuyq ravơu xanưm, ji muuyq ravơu xanưm dang đaji muuyq hngơy. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Lôôk be manưưn manưl truh apok tavek ku Kadraq, đaji muuyq sôôq adro biit laa manưưn manưl, tađôôy muut đnư, Kadraq atuq xuum chiuq uunq đôôyq dii oh ay, leh xung adro leq biq kaxêêt hlơơp, bơh xung dêq hloay raay e kawah hooy truh varơuq wiit xuum. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Lunư, hngơy ku Lôôk hnoq truh đaji adro atôk, đơu đom hngơy nưq, lawah plêêk hnoq tapol hlơơp đom hnưm ahna garung, ji dêq hloay tuôôy thưq hnoq biq phaq ka'lăk tuôôy biq ôôlh vuh jaq, măn vari ji kaluh varơuq dơơp đom nưq hnoq biq kahnoq vlôh. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp kadrơy đok: </char><char style="fqa">Dêq kaluh kajoq hnoq biq ôôlh vuh jaq, măn vari ji kaluh kông trinh tol nưq yôôych biq vuh vlôh vlo</char>.</note> <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Vii tôôy thưq nưq hnoq biq kaxêêt hlơơp đanưq, lunưq kơn băt dăt oh ay pheq xa măn đom đơơy riirh hlăng vah ji tuôq kul, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />takôô ji talăng jăk trôôch takôô hngơy rama truh ku Kơy Plêêk, vii tuôôy nưq kaluh tưng plêêk hnoq biq pa hyaak vii biq ôôlh vuh jaq, măn dêq tôôy thưq hnoq rook hoot vii biq vuh jaq tôq rahưk. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Bơh tyauq apok tavek ku Kadraq, haay đong takôô plêêk đơơu ji vari đơơu, đơu đnư aduq nưq varơuq hyioh jăk măn đnư.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Vii anưq, wơơy oh ay xung xiaq, vii kơq takôô kaluh varơuq nưq, dayh dêq paraat xôq jah Kadraq 'yo hloq laa leh e hlêêl tachoot ji leh e aduq đnooy ik, đom varơuq hrok hrol. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Ji pheq hlolh xuum chiuq atuq ku Lôôk haay laa vii vanong wơơt xok, kung đaji Phao-lô, manih oh ay thier xung xiaq ku haay, heq valơk ka oh ay, tyauq varơuq khôôt xet heq jah kahniq ka kơy, <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />ji đaji đom kaluh hla thư, tuôôy đnooy đom thư truh kaluh varơuq neq, aduq nưq e muuyq sôôq varơuq koq hlolh đơu khơl adro be hlolh xet ji leh dưk kajưk xok padoh hyaak bơyq, kung đaji dii kaluh talok Rahlăp Vah kadrơy, wih truh varơuq kaxêêt hlơơp ku kadih oot. <verse eid="2PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Jo nưq, wơơy oh ay thier xung xiaq, vii xet adroyq kaluh varơuq nưq, oh ay dayh jư xăk xôq oh ay leh huq dơơp hlơơp varơuq dưk kajưk ku oh ay đơu biq jarooy hooy hyaak hyul bơyh varơuq aluut pa ôôh ku khơl adro xơk tauq. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Bơh dayh kôt tok đom vanong plêêk ji varơuq hlolh xet Lôôk ji Wơơt Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. Apôôy vôôch tađnah tađnaak thuôk truh Kadraq hloay đom juneq ji truh aduq đơơy đơơy. Amen!<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>